{
 "description": "Requires a ChainHelix API key as bearer token, or 1 cent per call paid over Binance b402 in USDT, USDC, USD1 or U on BNB Smart Chain, or over x402 in USDC on the Base network. The order flow that was extracted on one chain, newest first: every detected victim transaction with its hash, the attacker and its transaction, the pool and protocol, block and position, the victim and attacker gas prices, the attacker gas price over the median gas price of the block, and the profit where measured. Filter by pool and by type (sandwich, backrun, frontrun, jit). window in minutes, default 60, max 1440; limit default 50, max 500. Every hash re-derives from a public RPC. Chains covered: bnb, ethereum, polygon, avalanche",
